    '|a||Reported speech in Russian: he advised us to go':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4120
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Pass on what someone said, asked, told you to do or advised in Russian: сказа́л, что; спроси́л, ли; сказа́л, что́бы; посове́товал.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 12440
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:afqsi1'
    '|a||How do you pass on what someone said, asked, told you to do, or advised? Второ́е января́. We''re in Moscow with Masha''s family, her ро́дственники.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 12160
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Masha''s brother Ива́н has phoned her with an idea. Послу́шайте.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4920
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:bm0ycl'
    '|b||Ива́н посове́товал нам пое́хать в Су́здаль.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2800
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:1jrm414'
    '|a||А как туда́ е́хать?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1560
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Он сказа́л, что снача́ла на́до е́хать на по́езде во Влади́мир, а пото́м на авто́бусе.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5320
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||А что ещё он сказа́л?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2240
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Он сказа́л, что́бы мы взя́ли тёплые ве́щи. Там моро́з!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3760
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||Who advised the trip? (посове́товал = advised)':
