      ms: 7880
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Advise whom? In the to-colour: нам, to us. Посове́товал мне, тебе́, Ма́ше.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8200
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:40t7yw'
    '|a||And then what to do: the infinitive, пое́хать.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4640
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:aewfim'
    '|a||Су́здаль has no station: снача́ла на по́езде во Влади́мир, а пото́м на авто́бусе.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6040
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:do2igz'
