      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:bzcrut'
    '|a||Он сказа́л, что́бы мы взя́ли тёплые ве́щи.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2960
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:11mxon6'
    '|a||Сказа́л, что́бы, and the past: he told us to. Like попроси́ла, что́бы from lesson 124.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8040
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:6ejxnw'
    '|a||Он сказа́л, что там моро́з: just a fact.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3600
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:yy5272'
    '|a||Four ways to pass on Ива́н''s words. «Там моро́з.» Сказа́л, что там моро́з: a fact.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8200
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:10pkgun'
    '|a||«Вы е́дете?» Спроси́л, е́дем ли мы: the key word, then ли.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6200
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:9b3x10'
    '|a||«Где вокза́л?» Спроси́л, где вокза́л: no ли.':
