      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1o2c845'
    '|a||On the расписа́ние, the timetable: an электри́чка, a local train, and the «Ла́сточка», a fast one.':
